      "position": "right",
      "widthRatio": 0.62,
      "top": 2904,
      "tag": "h2",
      "kind": "heading"
     },
     {
      "text": "Menyampaikan aspirasi dan pendapat mahasiswa kepada pihak fakultas.",
      "words": 8,
      "chars": 67,
      "lines": 2,
      "size": 27.7,
      "vw": 1.9,
